WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.000
Low water exposes the sand flats.

00:04.500 --> 00:07.500
The survey line runs east from the jetty.

00:08.500 --> 00:12.000
The flood tide begins to fill the channel.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.500
Current speed peaks near the marker.

00:16.500 --> 00:20.000
High water reaches the top of the gauge.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.500
Readings are logged every six minutes.
